{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17419","headline":"赠文敬太子挽歌词二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"赠文敬太子挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘石公封重，瑶山赠礼尊。\n归全荣备物，乐善积深恩。\n鴈沼寒波咽，鸾旌夕吹翻。\n唯余西靡树，千古霸陵原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}